    "text": "Fox5 KVVU\nwebsite\nNorth Las Vegas\nPolice release body-worn camera in deadly North Las Vegas police shooting\nBy Brittany Defran,\n51 minutes agoLAS VEGAS (FOX5) — A North Las Vegas officer shot and killed a man wielding 2 knives after allegedly hitting his mother. NLVPD responded to to the 3100 block of Emmons Avenue just before 2 p.m., near Lake Mead Boulevard and Pecos Road following reports of a domestic disturbance.\n1",
